{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794528289850,"sessionID":"ses_e2dcb0a25ffeKDrFVYdzDGhvxv","part":{"partID":"prt_1d238a187001vG7HkVTbWhAxzE","sessionID":"ses_e2dcb0a25ffeKDrFVYdzDGhvxv","messageID":"msg_1d238878d001fhoDTZzVAw0mGb","type":"tool","id":"call_093539d10c11496a8bf0017f","tool":"shell","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"command":"rg -n \"T032|command-speckit-(plan|complete|implement|resume)\" specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/005-recommendation-contract-and-brief/plan.md | head -40","workdir":"/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research"},"output":"(no output)","title":"shell","metadata":{"metadata":{"status":"completed","truncated":false,"exit":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"(no output)"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"command\":\"rg -n \\\"T032|command-speckit-(plan|complete|implement|resume)\\\" specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/005-recommendation-contract-and-brief/plan.md | head -40\",\"workdir\":\"/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research\"}"},"time":{"start":1794528289159,"end":1794528289850}}}}
{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794528289855,"sessionID":"ses_e2dcb0a25ffeKDrFVYdzDGhvxv","part":{"partID":"prt_1d2389ecf001L4TFahOU2wY2xt","sessionID":"ses_e2dcb0a25ffeKDrFVYdzDGhvxv","messageID":"msg_1d238878d001fhoDTZzVAw0mGb","type":"tool","id":"call_37dcaa54a24b496c94d2ffac","tool":"shell","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"command":"rg -n \"skill_advisor.py|PY\\b|Python scorer\" specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/005-recommendation-contract-and-brief/spec.md | head -40","workdir":"/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research"},"output":"61:A model that reads the hook brief sees `use command-speckit-save` or `use command-spec-kit-plan`, a raw scorer id that names no slash command and no policy. The public recommendation carries a `command` field only when a hub attaches one, and it never carries a policy, a kind or an owner, so a caller cannot tell whether to run, start or ask. When the daemon is down, the local Python scorer returns command rows such as `command-create-readme` for a plain prompt, and nothing says what a degraded brief may show.\n95:$ SPECKIT_SKILL_ADVISOR_FORCE_LOCAL=1 python3 .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/skill_advisor.py 'create a readme for the utils folder' | jq -c '[.[0:3][] | {skill, kind, source, passes_threshold}]'\n96:Native advisor unavailable (FORCE_LOCAL; freshness=unavailable); falling back to local Python scorer.\n114:$ rg -n 'HAND_AUTHORED_COMMAND_BRIDGE' .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/skill_advisor.py .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/lib .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/tests\n115:.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/skill_advisor.py:2304:HAND_AUTHORED_COMMAND_BRIDGES = {\n116:.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/skill_advisor.py:2374:HAND_AUTHORED_COMMAND_BRIDGE_OWNER_NORMALIZATION = {\n186:- A stated contract for a degraded result. The local Python scorer returns `command-create-readme` as a passing row for a plain prompt.\n214:- Typed `/memory:save` as prompt vocabulary in `explicit.ts`, `fusion.ts`, the Python scorer and the Gate 3 classifier. It matches what a user types, and five labelled corpus rows type it.\n229:| `ADV/scripts/skill_advisor.py` | Modify | Hand constants and `/prompt` residue deleted, four ids re-pointed |\n267:| REQ-011 | `HAND_AUTHORED_COMMAND_BRIDGES` and `HAND_AUTHORED_COMMAND_BRIDGE_OWNER_NORMALIZATION` are deleted from the Python scorer. `CommandBridgeProjection.routingEnabled` is required and `scoringCommandBridges` keeps rows with `routingEnabled === true`. |\n346:| Scope | 14/25 | About 24 files and 700 lines across the deriver, the handler, the renderer, the CLI, the Python scorer and tests |\n","title":"shell","metadata":{"metadata":{"status":"completed","truncated":false,"exit":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"61:A model that reads the hook brief sees `use command-speckit-save` or `use command-spec-kit-plan`, a raw scorer id that names no slash command and no policy. The public recommendation carries a `command` field only when a hub attaches one, and it never carries a policy, a kind or an owner, so a caller cannot tell whether to run, start or ask. When the daemon is down, the local Python scorer returns command rows such as `command-create-readme` for a plain prompt, and nothing says what a degraded brief may show.\n95:$ SPECKIT_SKILL_ADVISOR_FORCE_LOCAL=1 python3 .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/skill_advisor.py 'create a readme for the utils folder' | jq -c '[.[0:3][] | {skill, kind, source, passes_threshold}]'\n96:Native advisor unavailable (FORCE_LOCAL; freshness=unavailable); falling back to local Python scorer.\n114:$ rg -n 'HAND_AUTHORED_COMMAND_BRIDGE' .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/skill_advisor.py .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/lib .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/tests\n115:.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/skill_advisor.py:2304:HAND_AUTHORED_COMMAND_BRIDGES = {\n116:.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/skill_advisor.py:2374:HAND_AUTHORED_COMMAND_BRIDGE_OWNER_NORMALIZATION = {\n186:- A stated contract for a degraded result. The local Python scorer returns `command-create-readme` as a passing row for a plain prompt.\n214:- Typed `/memory:save` as prompt vocabulary in `explicit.ts`, `fusion.ts`, the Python scorer and the Gate 3 classifier. It matches what a user types, and five labelled corpus rows type it.\n229:| `ADV/scripts/skill_advisor.py` | Modify | Hand constants and `/prompt` residue deleted, four ids re-pointed |\n267:| REQ-011 | `HAND_AUTHORED_COMMAND_BRIDGES` and `HAND_AUTHORED_COMMAND_BRIDGE_OWNER_NORMALIZATION` are deleted from the Python scorer. `CommandBridgeProjection.routingEnabled` is required and `scoringCommandBridges` keeps rows with `routingEnabled === true`. |\n346:| Scope | 14/25 | About 24 files and 700 lines across the deriver, the handler, the renderer, the CLI, the Python scorer and tests |\n"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"command\":\"rg -n \\\"skill_advisor.py|PY\\\\b|Python scorer\\\" specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/005-recommendation-contract-and-brief/spec.md | head -40\",\"workdir\":\"/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research\"}"},"time":{"start":1794528288463,"end":1794528289855}}}}
