{"type":"text","timestamp":1794528472337,"sessionID":"ses_e2dcb0a25ffeKDrFVYdzDGhvxv","part":{"id":"prt_1d23b5c4b002UDKyDO75PC7YMB","sessionID":"ses_e2dcb0a25ffeKDrFVYdzDGhvxv","messageID":"msg_1d23b4b9b001IsGMf9rcJZTkg0","type":"text","text":"## T032 report\n\n**Task:** In `PY`, outside the generated blocks, replace each of the four `command-spec-kit-*` ids with its `command-speckit-*` id.\n\n**Finding: no non-generated occurrences remain, so no edit was required.**\n\n`PY` = `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/skill_advisor.py`\n\nEvery occurrence of `command-spec-kit-plan`, `-complete`, `-implement` and `-resume` is inside the `# BEGIN GENERATED COMMAND BRIDGES` / `# END GENERATED COMMAND BRIDGES` block (lines 2304–2887). The only non-generated occurrences of the old prefix are the ones the task explicitly excludes:\n\n- `command-spec-kit-deep-research` / `command-spec-kit-deep-review` (lines 290, 297, 3956, 3957) — deep ids, left alone\n- `SPECKIT_COMMAND_BRIDGE_PREFIXES` (line 505) — left alone\n\nThe hand-authored dictionaries that carried the four ids outside the generated block were removed by T009; the current working-tree diff for this file is 80 deletions and 0 insertions.\n\n**Files written:** none. No in-scope edit was needed.\n\n**Verify output** (`rg -n \"command-spec-kit-(plan|complete|implement|resume)\" $PY`):\n\n```\n2306:    \"command-spec-kit-plan\": {\n2310:        \"inventory_id\": \"command-spec-kit-plan\",\n2316:    \"command-spec-kit-complete\": {\n2320:        \"inventory_id\": \"command-spec-kit-complete\",\n2326:    \"command-spec-kit-implement\": {\n2330:        \"inventory_id\": \"command-spec-kit-implement\",\n2356:    \"command-spec-kit-resume\": {\n2360:        \"inventory_id\": \"command-spec-kit-resume\",\n2883:    \"command-spec-kit-resume\": \"system-spec-kit\",\n```\n\nSupporting check: an awk scan of the same file reported every one of those nine lines as `inside` the generated block; `ast.parse` on the file succeeded. The remaining in-block ids are the ones T034 regenerates.\n\n**Could not do:** nothing. The task is a no-op on the current tree because T009 already removed the only non-generated carriers of those ids.","time":{"start":1794528468043,"end":1794528472337}}}
